# W4 `/compact` whose notes request is refused twice (the conversation's
# model, then the other family's): the failure sentence, which stays.
gateway compact-fail-turns.json
work compact-ws
wait 3
type first question
key Enter
wait 3
type second question
key Enter
wait 2.5
type /compact
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap failed
wait 2
snap failed-3.5s
type third question
key Enter
wait 2.5
snap next-turn
gwlog
